#. ja: 月の監視者は、冒険者に告げたいことがあるようだ。
#. de: Der Mondwächter hat dir viel zu erzählen.
#. fr: Le veilleur sélénien a quelques derniers conseils à vous donner.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "The watcher would have you deal with the specters haunting the moon."
msgstr "Страж просит вас разобраться с призраками, что бродят по Луне."

#. ja: 気疎なげに囁く幻影と話す
#. de: Mit dem laut Klagenden sprechen
#. fr: Parler au spectre évanescent
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Speak with the faded spirit."
msgstr "Поговорить с бледным духом"

#. ja: 朧げに囁く幻影と話す
#. de: Mit dem weinerlich Klagenden sprechen
#. fr: Parler au spectre rêvasseur
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_TODO_01:1"
msgid "Speak with the dreaming spirit."
msgstr "Поговорить с грезящим духом"

#. ja: 寂しげに囁く幻影と話す
#. de: Mit dem bitter Klagenden sprechen
#. fr: Parler au spectre esseulé
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_TODO_02:1"
msgid "Speak with the forlorn spirit."
msgstr "Поговорить с убитым горем духом"

#. ja: 物憂げに囁く幻影と話す
#. de: Mit dem still Klagenden sprechen
#. fr: Parler au spectre morose
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_TODO_03:1"
msgid "Speak with the somber spirit."
msgstr "Поговорить с мрачным духом"

#. ja: 光を帯びた犬と話し、先導に従って移動
#. de: Mit dem gleißenden Hund sprechen und ihm folgen
#. fr: Parler au chien nimbé de lumière et le suivre
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_TODO_04:1"
msgid "Approach the lustrous dog and follow its lead."
msgstr "Подойти к сияющей собаке и следовать за ней"

#. ja: 儚げに囁く幻影と話す
#. de: Mit dem verzweifelt Klagenden sprechen
#. fr: Parler au spectre frustré
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_TODO_05:1"
msgid "Speak with the temperamental spirit."
msgstr "Поговорить с вспыльчивым духом"

#. ja: 儚げに囁く幻影と再度話す
#. de: Noch einmal mit dem verzweifelt Klagenden sprechen
#. fr: Reparler au spectre frustré
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_TODO_06:1"
msgid "Speak with the temperamental spirit again."
msgstr "Ещё раз поговорить со вспыльчивым духом"

#. ja: 光を帯びた犬と話し、先導に従って移動
#. de: Mit dem gleißenden Hund sprechen und ihm folgen
#. fr: Parler au chien nimbé de lumière et le suivre
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_TODO_07:1"
msgid "Approach the lustrous dog and follow its lead."
msgstr "Подойти к сияющей собаке и следовать за ней"

#. ja: 想いを囁く幻影と話す
#. de: Mit dem melancholisch Klagenden sprechen
#. fr: Parler au spectre tourmenté
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_TODO_08:1"
msgid "Speak with the anguished spirit."
msgstr "Поговорить с терзаемым духом"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>私たちを揺り起こすのは……誰……？</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Wer hat uns aus äonenlangem Schlaf erweckt?</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Qui est là...<nbsp>? Qui nous a tirés de notre long sommeil...<nbsp>?</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWONE4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWONE4397_100_000:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>From endless dreams...I awake...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Из бесконечных снов... я пробуждаюсь...</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>月面に浮かび上がった、贄の幻影たち……。<br>封印の「剣」を修復するため彼らを排除してほしいと言ったが、<br>なにも戦う必要はない。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Ich sagte, dass ich deine Hilfe benötige, die Erscheinungen loszuwerden. Aber das bedeutet nicht, dass du mit ihnen kämpfen musst.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Le sceau affaibli, les spectres des sacrifiés peuvent remonter jusqu'à la surface... Tu devras nous en débarrasser, afin que je répare les glaives.</ui-color>
#. speaker: WATCHEROFMOON
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_WATCHEROFMOON_000_000:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>You must confront those lost souls, yes, but you need not expel them by might of arms...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Да, вам предстоит встретиться с заблудшими душами, но прогонять их силой вовсе не обязательно...</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>多くの幻影は、ただ触れれば霧散するような、<br>淡く不確かな存在だ。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Sie sind vage Existenzen. Sie lösen sich auf, wenn man sie berührt.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Pour la plupart, leur présence tient de l'intangible, et les effleurer suffira à les faire disparaître.</ui-color>
#. speaker: WATCHEROFMOON
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_WATCHEROFMOON_000_001:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>A feather-touch, a firm word─simple methods may send them away, faint echoes as they are.</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Достаточно лёгкого прикосновения или твёрдого слова. Они лишь бледные отголоски прошлого, и этого может хватить, чтобы они ушли.</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>しかし、先ほど貴殿が遭遇したように、<br>彼らの想いが形を成して襲い掛かってくることもある……。<br>それだけは、注意してほしい。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Doch es gibt Fälle, in denen ihre Gefühle Gestalt annehmen. Du hast es bereits erlebt. Dann bleibt nur der Kampf.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>D'autres, en revanche, peuvent matérialiser leurs sentiments et t'assaillir comme celui que tu as croisé en venant ici. Prends garde à eux.</ui-color>
#. speaker: WATCHEROFMOON
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_WATCHEROFMOON_000_002:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Ware the strength of sentiment that drives them, however. Emotions that do not fade even with the passage of centuries...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Но берегитесь чувств, что движут ими. Иные эмоции не угасают даже за века...</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>では、私は「剣」の修復を続行しよう。<br>まだ距離はあるが、貴殿以外の、招かれざる訪問者たちが、<br>着実にこの区画へ近づいてきているのを感じるのでね……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Ich werde damit fortfahren, die Schwerter wieder instand zu setzen, denn ich spüre, wie sich unwillkommene Besucher nähern<nbsp>...</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Je vais poursuivre mes efforts de réparations, pendant que tu officieras, mais... presse-toi. Je sens que des intrus s'approchent... Et malgré la distance qui nous sépare encore, ils ne tarderont pas à nous rejoindre...</ui-color>
#. speaker: WATCHEROFMOON
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_WATCHEROFMOON_000_003:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>And make haste. Though yet distant, unwelcome guests draw closer...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>А теперь поспешите. Незваные гости пока далеко, но уже приближаются...</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>封印の「剣」は、霊水、霊氷、霊土、霊火、霊雷、霊風の6つ。<br>そのうち今残っているのは、霊雷と霊風の2つのみだ。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Es gibt sechs Siegel: das Schwert der Meere, der Gletscher, der Erde, der Flammen, der Gewitter und der Stürme. Übrig sind nur noch die letzten zwei.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Eau, glace, terre, feu, foudre et vent... Six glaives pour six éléments... Seuls ceux de foudre et de vent restent fermement ancrés et retiennent encore Zordiarche.</ui-color>
#. speaker: WATCHEROFMOON
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_WATCHEROFMOON_000_010:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Of the six elemental brands, only those of levin and wind are intact.</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Из шести стихийных клейм целы лишь клейма молнии и ветра.</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>それらを招かれざる訪問者たちが壊すまでに、<br>どうにか「剣」の修復を終えて、<br>堅牢な再封印を施さなければならない。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Ich will die Siegel erneuert haben, bevor man die letzten zwei Schwerter zerstört.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Il nous faut à tout prix réparer les autres, avant que ceux qui t'ont précédé<if $gn4>e</if> ici ne détruisent ces deux derniers. Zordiarche doit impérativement rester prisonnier.</ui-color>
#. speaker: WATCHEROFMOON
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_WATCHEROFMOON_000_011:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>If the other brands are not reforged, Zodiark may yet be freed.</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Если не восстановить остальные клейма, Зодиарк может вырваться на свободу.</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>そのためには、修復を妨げている、<br>ゾディアークの贄の幻影たちを掃わなければ。<br>貴殿にはその協力を頼みたいのだ。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Die Erscheinungen, Diener Zodiarks, hindern mich daran. Deshalb sollst du sie beseitigen.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Nous pouvons y parvenir ensemble. Débarrasse-moi des spectres des sacrifiés qui m'en empêchent, je te prie.</ui-color>
#. speaker: WATCHEROFMOON
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_WATCHEROFMOON_000_012:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Find the spirits of the sacrificed, and do what must be done...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Найдите духов принесённых в жертву и сделайте то, что должно...</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>ついに……目覚めのときなのか……？</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Ist die Zeit des Erwachsens gekommen?</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Le jour de notre réveil est-il arrivé...<nbsp>?</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWTWO4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWTWO4397_000_015:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>...Awaken? Is it...is it time...?</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>...Пробудиться? Неужели... уже пора?..</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>私は……そう、私たちは……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Ich muss ... Ja, wir werden<nbsp>...</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Je suis... Non, c'est vrai... <i>Nous</i> sommes...</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWTHREE4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWTHREE4397_000_020:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>I was... We were...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Я был... Мы были...</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>懐かしい、あの日々の何もかもが……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Wie ich mich nach unseren alten Tagen sehne!</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Allons-nous enfin retrouver cette époque nostalgique...<nbsp>?</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWFOUR4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWFOUR4397_000_025:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Those halcyon days...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Те безмятежные дни...</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>今はいつかしら……。<br>長く……長く……眠っていた気がする……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Wie lange habe ich geschlafen? Einen Wimpernschlag? Tausend mal tausend Äonen?</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>J'ai le sentiment de m'éveiller après un long sommeil... À quelle époque sommes-nous<nbsp>?</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWONE4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWONE4397_000_030:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Where...when... How long...?</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Где... когда... Как долго?..</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>そう……時は流れた……。<br>すべては、むかしむかしのことだ……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>So viel Zeit ist vergangen. Alles liegt so weit zurück.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Non... Tout cela remonte à si loin... Des éons se sont écoulés...</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWTWO4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWTWO4397_000_040:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Was it truly...so long ago...?</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Неужели... прошло столько времени?..</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>あのころの私たちは、星と調和していた……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Damals waren wir im Einklang mit dem Gestirn<nbsp>...</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Nous étions en harmonie avec notre belle planète...</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWTHREE4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWTHREE4397_000_050:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>We were happy... At peace with the star.</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Мы были счастливы... жили в ладу со звездой.</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>自然を紐解いては、新たな種を創り出し……<br>在るべきものを丹念に選んで……大いに栄えさせた……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Wir entschlüsselten das Alphabet der Natur und schufen neues Leben. Mit Sorgfalt entschieden wir, welche Arten dem Gestirn Nutzen brächten.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Nous avions percé les secrets de la nature, créé pour sa prospérité de nouvelles espèces que nous choisissions judicieusement.</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWTHREE4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWTHREE4397_000_051:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>We nurtured it. Helped it grow. With our will, our creations...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Мы взращивали её, помогали ей расцветать. Нашей волей, нашими творениями...</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>ああ……そうだ……。<br>あのころ、我々はまさに星の意志であり、細胞だった……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Wir waren der Wille des Planeten.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Je me souviens... Nous étions la volonté de la planète...</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWFOUR4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWFOUR4397_000_060:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>We were the star's beating heart. Its life...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Мы были бьющимся сердцем звезды. Её жизнью...</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>この命こそが星に流るる血の一滴……<br>己が身のごとく……星を育め……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Jede Seele ein Blutstropfen in seinen Venen. </ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Elle, un organisme, nous, ses cellules... Et notre énergie vitale, le sang qui coulait dans ses veines...</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWFOUR4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWFOUR4397_000_061:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Every soul a drop of blood flowing through its veins...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Каждая душа — капля крови, текущая по её жилам...</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>そのために、我々は望むだけ生きた……。<br>学び、創り、星を善くしていった。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Wir lebten, lernten, schufen und machten den Planeten zu einem besseren Ort.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Nous la cultivions et la voyions grandir... Chacun de nous apprenait, pensait, et construisait afin de l'embellir...</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWFOUR4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWFOUR4397_000_062:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>To live. To learn, to create...to make better.</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Жить. Учиться, творить... делать мир лучше.</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>欠けることなく満たされていたのだ……。<br>星も、我々も……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Nichts ließ zu wünschen übrig. Weder das Gestirn noch wir.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Nous étions des êtres pleins et entiers... tout comme elle...</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWFOUR4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWFOUR4397_000_063:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>The star flourished...as did we.</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Звезда процветала... и мы вместе с ней.</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>なあ、そうだろう……？</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>So war es doch?</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>N'est-ce pas<nbsp>?</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWFOUR4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWFOUR4397_000_064:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Do you remember...?</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Ты помнишь?..</ui-color>"

#. ja: 「霊水の剣」の周囲には、もう幻影がいないようだ……。<br>この「剣」の修復が妨げられることはなくなっただろう。
#. de: Rund um das Schwert der Meere sind keine Erscheinungen mehr, welche die Instandsetzung des Siegels stören könnten.
#. fr: Vous ne voyez plus aucun spectre autour du glaive chavirant. Le veilleur sélénien devrait maintenant être en mesure de le réparer.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SYSTEM_000_065:1"
msgid "As the whispers die, the final spirit fades. No shadows of times long lost remain around the Drowning Brand."
msgstr "Шёпот затих, и последний дух исчез. У Клейма утопления больше не осталось теней далёкого прошлого."

#. ja: 光を帯びた犬が、こちらをじっと見つめている。<br>警戒した様子はなく、なぜかとても懐かれている……。
#. de: Der gleißende Hund sieht dich freundlich an.
#. fr: Ce chien nimbé de lumière vous observe, sans aucune défiance à votre égard. À vrai dire, il semble même vous apprécier.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SYSTEM_000_066:1"
msgid "An unusually lustrous dog is gazing at you with what seems to be fond anticipation."
msgstr "Необычайно сияющая собака с нетерпением смотрит на вас. Похоже, она вам рада."

#. ja: 犬は途中で立ち止まり、こちらを待っているようだ。<br>……ついてこいということだろうか？
#. de: Der Hund bleibt stehen und blickt zu dir, als würde er auf dich warten.
#. fr: L'étrange canin s'est arrêté, comme pour vous attendre. Peut-être vous invite-t-il à le suivre<nbsp>?
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SYSTEM_000_067:1"
msgid "It appears to be waiting for you to follow it."
msgstr "Похоже, она ждёт, когда вы последуете за ней."

#. ja: <ui-color 547>ああ……黒い記憶が、こみあげてくる……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Der Schleier des Vergessens lichtet sich<nbsp>...</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Toutes ces pensées noires... Elles affluent, débordent même...</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWFIVE4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWFIVE4397_000_070:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>These...blackened memories...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Эти... почерневшие воспоминания...</ui-color>"

#. ja: （★未使用／削除予定★）
#. de: Der gleißende Hund läuft nun voraus. Verliere ihn nicht aus den Augen und bleibe ihm dicht auf den Fersen.
#. fr: Le chien nimbé de lumière vous guide. Restez près de lui pour ne pas le perdre de vue.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SYSTEM_000_080:1"
msgid "Follow the lustrous dog and try not to fall behind."
msgstr "Следуйте за сияющей собакой и старайтесь не отставать."

#. ja: 光を帯びた犬は足を止めた。<br>次なる「剣」のそばに佇む幻影を、静かに見つめている。
#. de: Der Hund bleibt stehen und blickt stumm auf die Erscheinungen in der Nähe des Schwertes.
#. fr: Le chien nimbé de lumière vous a guidé<if $gn4>e</if> jusqu'au glaive suivant. Il se contente maintenant de fixer du regard le spectre qui se trouve à côté.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SYSTEM_000_081:1"
msgid "The dog silently regards the spirit that lurks near the brand."
msgstr "Собака молча смотрит на духа, притаившегося возле клейма."

#. ja: 光を帯びた犬は、まるで対処を促すかのように、<br>「霊氷の剣」のそばに佇む幻影を見つめている。
#. de: Der Hund blickt auf die Erscheinungen in der Nähe des Schwerts der Gletscher.
#. fr: Le chien reste le museau braqué en direction du spectre au pied du glaive mordant, comme pour vous donner une indication.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SYSTEM_000_090:1"
msgid "Perhaps the dog will let you pet it once you have dealt with the lingering spirit."
msgstr "Возможно, собака позволит себя погладить, когда вы разберётесь с духом, что остался рядом."

#. ja: <ui-color 547>そうよ……私たちも星も、満たされていた……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Ja. Es herrschte Erfüllung. Für das Gestirn wie für uns.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>C'est vrai... Nous comme notre planète... des êtres pleins et entiers...</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWFIVE4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWFIVE4397_000_100:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>We and the star were fulfilled...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Да... Мы и звезда были едины...</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>なにもかも、うまくいっていたの……。<br>悲しみなんて、知らなかった……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Alles war gut. Es gab weder Trauer noch Leid.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Tout allait pour le mieux dans le meilleur des mondes... Nous ignorions la tristesse...</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWFIVE4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWFIVE4397_000_101:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Wanted for naught, mourned for naught...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Всё было хорошо... Мы не знали горя...</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>なのに、あの恐るべき日がやってきたんだわ……！<br>「終末の災厄」が……アァ……ッ！</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Doch dann kam der Tag, der die Letzten Tage einläutete. Ah<nbsp>...</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Alors comment...<nbsp>!? Alors pourquoi ce jour maudit est-il venu sonner notre glas<nbsp>!? L'apocalypse... L'apo... Aaaah<nbsp>!</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWFIVE4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWFIVE4397_000_102:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>So why... <i>Why</i> did it have to end!?</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Но почему... <i>почему</i> всё должно было закончиться?!</ui-color>"

#. ja: 幻影の苦悶が形を成し、襲い掛かってきた！！
#. de: Das Leid der Erscheinung hat Gestalt angenommen und greift dich an!
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Les souffrances du spectre agonisant prennent forme et vous attaquent<nbsp>!</ui-color>
#. speaker: POPMESSAGE
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_POPMESSAGE_000_105:1"
msgid "The spirit's resentment takes form and lashes out!"
msgstr "Негодование духа обрело форму и бросилось в атаку!"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>あの災厄によって、<br>私たちは、はじめて死を「押し付けられた」。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Erst die Letzten Tage lehrten uns, was der Tod bedeutet.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>La mort qu'autrefois nous accueillions... L'apocalypse nous l'a <i>infligée</i> pour la première fois...</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWFIVE4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWFIVE4397_000_110:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>The Final Days taught us to fear a death forced upon us.</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Последние дни научили нас бояться смерти, навязанной против нашей воли.</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>同胞が、望みも役目も果たせずに終わっていく……。<br>予定にない別離が、突如としてやってくる……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Meine Brüder gingen, ohne ihre Träume und Pflichten erfüllt zu haben. Sie gaben ihre Leben für eine neue Aufgabe.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Nos frères et sœurs périssaient l'un après l'autre... sans avoir accompli tous leurs desseins, assouvi tous leurs désirs... Ils nous quittaient avant même que nous puissions leur dire au revoir...</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWFIVE4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWFIVE4397_000_111:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>The injustice of duties and dreams left unfulfilled. The grief of unexpected partings...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Наши близкие уходили, не исполнив желаний и не выполнив своего предназначения... А разлука, которой никто не ждал, приходила внезапно...</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>闇のように素早く……灰のように冷たく……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Der Abschied kam schnell wie die Finsternis. Unsere Trauer war kalt wie die Asche.</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Des séparations aussi brusques que les Ténèbres... aussi froides que la cendre...</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWFIVE4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWFIVE4397_000_112:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Swift as darkness, cold as ash.</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Стремительная, как тьма... холодная, как пепел.</ui-color>"

#. ja: <ui-color 547>あぁ……なんてこと……！<br>これほど恐ろしく、悲しいことが、存在し得るというの……！？</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>Kann es etwas Schreck<shy>li<shy>che<shy>res, etwas Traurigeres geben?</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Comment une telle tragédie peut-elle se produire...<nbsp>!? Un drame aussi triste se nouer<nbsp>!?</ui-color>
#. speaker: SHADOWFIVE4397
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SHADOWFIVE4397_000_113:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Such tragedy, yet no catharsis! Such truth, yet no consolation...</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>Столь страшная трагедия — и никакого облегчения! Столь горькая правда — и никакого утешения...</ui-color>"

#. ja: 「霊氷の剣」の周囲には、ほかに幻影がいないようだ……。<br>この「剣」の修復が妨げられることはなくなっただろう。
#. de: Rund um das Schwert der Gletscher sind keine Erscheinungen mehr, welche die Instandsetzung des Siegels stören könnten.
#. fr: Vous ne voyez aucun autre spectre autour du glaive mordant. Le veilleur sélénien devrait maintenant être en mesure de le réparer.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SYSTEM_000_114:1"
msgid "As the whispers die, the spirit fades. All is silent and still around the Numbing Brand."
msgstr "Шёпот затих, и дух исчез. У Клейма оцепенения воцарились тишина и покой."

#. ja: <ui-color 547>ああ、ゾディアークよ……。</ui-color>
#. de: <ui-color 547>O Zodiark ...</ui-color>
#. fr: <ui-color 547>Ô Zordiarche...</ui-color>
#. speaker: ANCIENTSHADOWA
#. macro: <ui-color 547> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 547 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_ANCIENTSHADOWA_000_120:1"
msgid "<ui-color 547>Oh, great Zodiark!</ui-color>"
msgstr "<ui-color 547>О, великий Зодиарк!</ui-color>"

#. ja: 光を帯びた犬は、再びこちらを見つめている……。<br>また「先導」してくれるようだ。<br>離れすぎてしまわないよう、後を追いかけよう。
#. de: Der gleißende Hund sieht dich wieder an. Er wird dich weiter führen. Verliere ihn nicht aus den Augen und bleibe ihm dicht auf den Fersen.
#. fr: Le chien nimbé de lumière vous guide à nouveau. Restez près de lui pour ne pas le perdre de vue.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SYSTEM_000_130:1"
msgid "The lustrous dog is once again staring at you expectantly, and who are you to deny it? Follow and try not to fall behind."
msgstr "Сияющая собака снова смотрит на вас с ожиданием. Ну как ей отказать? Следуйте за ней и старайтесь не отставать."

#. ja: 光を帯びた犬は足を止めた。<br>次なる「剣」のそばに佇む幻影を、静かに見つめている。
#. de: Der Hund bleibt stehen und blickt stumm auf die Erscheinungen in der Nähe des Schwertes.
#. fr: Le chien nimbé de lumière vous a guidé<if $gn4>e</if> jusqu'au glaive suivant. Il se contente maintenant de fixer du regard le spectre qui se trouve à côté.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SYSTEM_000_131:1"
msgid "The dog silently regards the shadow that lurks near the brand."
msgstr "Собака молча смотрит на тень, притаившуюся возле клейма."

#. ja: 光を帯びた犬は、一度こちらに目を遣ったあと、<br>「霊土の剣」に視線を戻した。<br>あちらに行けということだろうか……。
#. de: Der Hund blickt dich kurz an und sieht dann auf das Schwert der Erde. Will er, dass du dorthin gehst?
#. fr: L'étrange animal a tourné la tête vers vous, puis en direction du glaive écrasant, comme s'il vous invitait à vous en approcher.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/043/AktKmb118_04397:TEXT_AKTKMB118_04397_SYSTEM_000_140:1"
msgid "The dog continues to focus on the shadow, as if to say, “Stop petting me and get on with it, please.”"
msgstr "Собака продолжает смотреть на тень, словно говорит: «Хватит меня гладить, пора за дело, пожалуйста!»"
